WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.534 --> 00:00:05.451
- Wait, do you like me?

00:00:06.379 --> 00:00:07.379
- Of course.

00:00:08.809 --> 00:00:10.805
- What's my name?

00:00:10.805 --> 00:00:11.638
- Sarah.

00:00:13.024 --> 00:00:14.423
- It's Jenny.

00:00:14.423 --> 00:00:17.340
- [Man] That's what I meant to say.

00:00:18.506 --> 00:00:20.697
- Fuck you. (chuckling)

00:00:20.697 --> 00:00:24.030
- [Man] I swear Jenny was my next guess.

00:00:24.934 --> 00:00:26.398
- Okay,

00:00:26.398 --> 00:00:29.245
I'm gonna sleep with you,

00:00:29.245 --> 00:00:32.025
but you're a fucking asshole.

00:00:32.025 --> 00:00:35.525
(instrumental rock music)

00:00:48.651 --> 00:00:51.151
- You want to go to breakfast?

00:00:52.092 --> 00:00:53.889
- Oh, sorry.

00:00:53.889 --> 00:00:56.722
I have to finish up some homework.

00:01:04.508 --> 00:01:08.317
- Do you want to go to
the movies with me later?

00:01:08.317 --> 00:01:12.666
- Oh sorry, I have to take
my buddy to the airport.

00:01:12.666 --> 00:01:16.166
(instrumental rock music)

00:01:22.260 --> 00:01:25.371
- You want to go out sometime?

00:01:25.371 --> 00:01:26.204
- Sorry,

00:01:27.740 --> 00:01:30.062
I have an appointment.

00:01:30.062 --> 00:01:32.229
- I never gave you a date.

00:01:34.411 --> 00:01:37.911
(instrumental rock music)

00:01:42.829 --> 00:01:46.079
(church bells ringing)

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:49.642
- Hey, this was really fun.

00:01:49.642 --> 00:01:53.295
- Yeah, we should go
have a drink sometime.

00:01:53.295 --> 00:01:57.462
- Oh I have to take my friend
to the airport, actually.

00:01:58.761 --> 00:02:00.594
- I never said a time.

00:02:02.755 --> 00:02:05.588
- I just have a really busy month.

00:02:08.938 --> 00:02:11.245
(phone ringing)

00:02:11.245 --> 00:02:13.123
- Yo, what up man?

00:02:13.123 --> 00:02:14.932
Glad you're still alive.

00:02:14.932 --> 00:02:17.256
You chugged enough Fireball
for the whole party.

00:02:17.256 --> 00:02:20.417
And then some. (chuckling)

00:02:20.417 --> 00:02:23.500
Yeah, actually, her name was Madison.

00:02:25.382 --> 00:02:28.140
I don't know, I think I'm gonna
hang back tonight, actually.

00:02:28.140 --> 00:02:30.723
Got some homework to finish up.

00:02:36.204 --> 00:02:39.704
(instrumental rock music)

00:03:00.668 --> 00:03:03.751
- Cheers (mumbling).

00:03:04.769 --> 00:03:06.646
Fucking apple cider.

00:03:06.646 --> 00:03:07.935
- [Man In Black Hat] Yeah
I'm not down for this.

00:03:07.935 --> 00:03:08.768
- No. (chuckling)

00:03:08.768 --> 00:03:12.026
- [Man In Black Hat] Not at all.

00:03:12.026 --> 00:03:13.884
I'm gonna go to the
bathroom, I'll be right back.

00:03:13.884 --> 00:03:14.717
- Yeah.

00:03:16.026 --> 00:03:17.321
- [Madison] Thank you for this.

00:03:17.321 --> 00:03:18.959
- Yeah, so you were checking up on school,

00:03:18.959 --> 00:03:20.824
everything good this semester, for you?

00:03:20.824 --> 00:03:22.876
- (Laughing) Yeah,
everything's perfectly fine.

00:03:22.876 --> 00:03:24.307
- Yeah, nice, nice, I just
wanted to make sure you're--

00:03:24.307 --> 00:03:25.714
- [Elliot] Hey, Madison.

00:03:25.714 --> 00:03:27.415
- Hey, Eli.

00:03:27.415 --> 00:03:28.665
- Elliot, from.

00:03:29.931 --> 00:03:30.981
- Oh yeah.

00:03:30.981 --> 00:03:32.427
- Last night slash this morning.

00:03:32.427 --> 00:03:35.691
- Yeah, this is John from tonight.

00:03:35.691 --> 00:03:36.524
- Hey.

00:03:39.428 --> 00:03:40.671
- Can I talk to you?

00:03:40.671 --> 00:03:41.983
- Sure.
- For a second?

00:03:41.983 --> 00:03:42.816
- Sorry.

00:03:47.703 --> 00:03:49.130
- Hey, what's up?

00:03:49.130 --> 00:03:49.963
- Nothing.

00:03:51.174 --> 00:03:52.614
What's going on?

00:03:52.614 --> 00:03:55.382
- You haven't texted me back.

00:03:55.382 --> 00:03:57.794
- Oh, yeah, I told you I was busy.

00:03:57.794 --> 00:03:59.127
- Busy with him?

00:04:00.754 --> 00:04:02.172
- Yeah, is that a problem?

00:04:02.172 --> 00:04:03.284
- No, it was just,

00:04:03.284 --> 00:04:04.627
I thought we had a good time.

00:04:04.627 --> 00:04:06.572
- Yeah, we did, we had a lot of fun.

00:04:06.572 --> 00:04:07.722
So we should hang out again.

00:04:07.722 --> 00:04:11.043
- Sure, okay, but tonight I'm
hanging out with John, so.

00:04:11.043 --> 00:04:14.086
- When do we get to hang out?

00:04:14.086 --> 00:04:17.086
- I don't know, I'll text you, okay?

00:04:18.144 --> 00:04:21.231
- Hey, you don't have a
very good track record

00:04:21.231 --> 00:04:22.398
of doing that.

00:04:23.453 --> 00:04:24.760
- Okay, Elliot.

00:04:24.760 --> 00:04:26.843
Can I be honest with you?

00:04:28.214 --> 00:04:29.714
- [Elliot] Please.

00:04:30.730 --> 00:04:32.080
- Last night I was drunk,
and I thought you were

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:33.974
really cute, so I hooked up with you.

00:04:33.974 --> 00:04:36.838
But isn't that your Thursday night routine

00:04:36.838 --> 00:04:38.489
with girls around here?

00:04:38.489 --> 00:04:39.639
- That's not true.

00:04:39.639 --> 00:04:40.795
- Really?
- No.

00:04:40.795 --> 00:04:41.628
- Okay.

00:04:43.183 --> 00:04:45.407
Well, I just got out of a
relationship really recently

00:04:45.407 --> 00:04:48.275
and I don't want a boyfriend, and I guess

00:04:48.275 --> 00:04:49.942
you were just there.

00:04:51.280 --> 00:04:52.864
- I was your rebound.

00:04:52.864 --> 00:04:54.649
- I had a really, really good time.

00:04:54.649 --> 00:04:58.316
I just don't want
somebody buying me brunch.

00:04:59.782 --> 00:05:01.193
- I'm sorry, I'm just,

00:05:01.193 --> 00:05:05.028
this has never happened to me before, so.

00:05:05.028 --> 00:05:06.708
- Really, (chuckling) oh no,

00:05:06.708 --> 00:05:08.068
I hope you didn't think I was gonna fall

00:05:08.068 --> 00:05:09.622
madly in love with you or something.

00:05:09.622 --> 00:05:10.508
- No.

00:05:10.508 --> 00:05:12.669
- [Madison] Okay, well did
you fall in love with me?

00:05:12.669 --> 00:05:13.502
- No.

00:05:15.113 --> 00:05:17.684
- Okay, so we're good then.

00:05:17.684 --> 00:05:19.631
- [Elliot] Yeah.

00:05:19.631 --> 00:05:20.594
- Friends?

00:05:20.594 --> 00:05:21.427
- Friends.

00:05:23.038 --> 00:05:25.994
- Cool, you want to join
John and I for a drink?

00:05:25.994 --> 00:05:26.911
- I'm good.

00:05:28.263 --> 00:05:30.596
- Okay, I'll see you around.

00:05:33.767 --> 00:05:37.684
Hey, sorry about that,
yeah, it's totally fine.

00:05:41.189 --> 00:05:43.346
Tell me the rest of the
story about Iceland.

00:05:43.346 --> 00:05:45.740
- Yeah, so okay, so we're
driving up this hill

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:47.479
(mumbling) all these crazy (mumbling).

00:05:47.479 --> 00:05:48.312
- Mhm.

